# selectle, the tile selector, its controls window at 10 10 (positions below are its vib positions plus 10): Meta-O (Alt) opens an image
# through the library's dialog (wwwcube.gif of the oracle's tree, the dialog's field holding 50 characters), the 16 x 16 selection is
# chosen, grown once (w + h +) and moved to the middle of the image (x y 1/2), Meta-T tiles the selection over the image, and the quit button ends the program by itself
