keydown Alt_L
key o
keyup Alt_L
wait
type /home/packages/icon/icon-master/doc/wwwcube.gif
key Return
wait
move 315 91
press 1
release 1
wait
move 146 50
press 1
release 1
wait
move 250 226
press 1
release 1
